# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Veldora FX — Stellar Testnet
#
# No environment variables are required. Contract addresses come from
# lib/fx-testnet.json (router, TRY demo oracle, rGBP/rTRY and `previous`
# rollback addresses) and lib/config.ts (Circle USDC/EURC, Reflector, demo
# accounts). Do not set NEXT_PUBLIC_RISE_* overrides: they are not applied in
# the browser and would make the server-rendered page and the client disagree.
#
# The Mock Anchor (Fund) needs no API key: it uses SEP-1 discovery and SEP-10
# authentication with the connected wallet. Testnet mock bank only.
#
# Operational scripts sign with Stellar CLI identities, never with secrets in
# files: rise-deployer (router/oracle admin), rise-lp1, rise-lp2,
# rise-wallet-a, rise-wallet-b. List them with `stellar keys ls`.
#
# NEVER commit secret keys. .env*, .dev.vars, work/ and outputs/ are ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: force the TRY demo snapshot price (USD per 1 TRY, 14 decimals)
# instead of the Mock Anchor rate that `npm run try:refresh` uses.
# RISE_DEMO_TRY_USD_14=
